From: ios-mh2lm
Subject: mh2lm: contain rollback failures by group and enforce PMIC log severity

Quarantine independently gateable APIDs when PMIC restoration fails.
Keep shared IRQ shutdown for unverified isolation. Grade all PMIC logs.

